   (#1501).
+* Fix a `TypeError` in the `toc` extension when a heading has an `id` attribute
+  without a value, such as `# Heading {: id }` with `attr_list`. Such a heading
+  is now treated as having no id: it gets the auto-generated id and appears in
+  the table of contents.
 
